<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειρό-κᾰλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ignorant of the beautiful,
				tasteless, vulgar,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ἀπαίδευτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					775b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ λόγους ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.44d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἡγοῦμαι πάντων μεμνῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειροκαλία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.10.5
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					244c
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <i>foolishly, rashly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				11.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
